{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XpaGFTuB2SeahFKeVQZ76t","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer in the email discussion about KIP-1279: Cluster Mirroring.\\\\n\\\\n**The final RPC names were:**\\\\n- **`StartMirrorTopics`** (renamed from `AddTopicsToMirror`)\\\\n- **`StopMirrorTopics`** (renamed from `RemoveTopicsFromMirror`)\\\\n\\\\nThis change was documented in a response from Federico Valeri addressing a comment from Andrew Schofield about the confusion between add/remove and pause/resume operations. The response states:\\\\n\\\\n> \\\\\\\"We changed AddTopicsToMirror/RemoveTopicsFromMirror to StartMirrorTopics/StopMirrorTopics. We will still keep the same semantics though. Stop can be used for failover or migration use cases, and pause for 'pausing mirroring without making the topic writable' (maintenance).\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n**Source:** `/store/events/2026/04/30/mail-d143b0b41a8baaf69dfb3a1d-b13eb2ca.md` (lines 73-77)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"events/2026/03/06/mail-3ff994af98687f284b08fecb-d28df905.md\\\",\\\"events/2026/04/30/mail-d143b0b41a8baaf69dfb3a1d-b13eb2ca.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":23.95,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":1,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":132028,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":39630,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.1009168,\\\"input_tokens\\\":74,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1676}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a2946f3a-b269-46f7-ad4b-ad5047585403","uuid":"75839537-416d-4116-a249-8ad5da031b0a","timestamp":"2026-09-27T19:09:30.958Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer in the email discussion about KIP-1279: Cluster Mirroring.\\\\n\\\\n**The final RPC names were:**\\\\n- **`StartMirrorTopics`** (renamed from `AddTopicsToMirror`)\\\\n- **`StopMirrorTopics`** (renamed from `RemoveTopicsFromMirror`)\\\\n\\\\nThis change was documented in a response from Federico Valeri addressing a comment from Andrew Schofield about the confusion between add/remove and pause/resume operations. The response states:\\\\n\\\\n> \\\\\\\"We changed AddTopicsToMirror/RemoveTopicsFromMirror to StartMirrorTopics/StopMirrorTopics. We will still keep the same semantics though. Stop can be used for failover or migration use cases, and pause for 'pausing mirroring without making the topic writable' (maintenance).\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n**Source:** `/store/events/2026/04/30/mail-d143b0b41a8baaf69dfb3a1d-b13eb2ca.md` (lines 73-77)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"events/2026/03/06/mail-3ff994af98687f284b08fecb-d28df905.md\\\",\\\"events/2026/04/30/mail-d143b0b41a8baaf69dfb3a1d-b13eb2ca.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":23.95,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":1,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":132028,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":39630,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.1009168,\\\"input_tokens\\\":74,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1676}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer in the email discussion about KIP-1279: Cluster Mirroring.\\n\\n**The final RPC names were:**\\n- **`StartMirrorTopics`** (renamed from `AddTopicsToMirror`)\\n- **`StopMirrorTopics`** (renamed from `RemoveTopicsFromMirror`)\\n\\nThis change was documented in a response from Federico Valeri addressing a comment from Andrew Schofield about the confusion between add/remove and pause/resume operations. The response states:\\n\\n> \\\"We changed AddTopicsToMirror/RemoveTopicsFromMirror to StartMirrorTopics/StopMirrorTopics. We will still keep the same semantics though. Stop can be used for failover or migration use cases, and pause for 'pausing mirroring without making the topic writable' (maintenance).\\\"\\n\\n**Source:** `/store/events/2026/04/30/mail-d143b0b41a8baaf69dfb3a1d-b13eb2ca.md` (lines 73-77)\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"store\",\"events/2026/03/06/mail-3ff994af98687f284b08fecb-d28df905.md\",\"events/2026/04/30/mail-d143b0b41a8baaf69dfb3a1d-b13eb2ca.md\"],\"seconds\":23.95,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":1,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":132028,\"cache_write_tokens\":39630,\"cost_usd\":0.1009168,\"input_tokens\":74,\"output_tokens\":1676}}"}}}
